{"product_id":"bachelor-dad-my-journey-to-fatherhood-and-more","title":"Bachelor Dad My Journey to Fatherhood and More","description":"\u003cp\u003eHow easy or difficult is it to be a single father in India?  How does the world react when a Bollywood celebrity becomes the first man to have a child via surrogacy?    1998  A superstar dad  A successful sister  A growing production empire    Yet a young Tusshar Kapoor was sitting far away from the arc lights in the US, working as a financial analyst, until circumstances led him to return to India to pursue a career in entertainment.    Little did he know that a totally different journey was awaiting him in the years to come; that he would make a life altering choice while on a car journey that would eventually make him India's first celebrity single dad.    Written in a frank, fun, no-holds-barred and incisive first-person narrative, Tusshar reveals interesting childhood anecdotes, the process of raising a child as a single man in India, how the search for the perfect soulmate doesn't stop after having a child and finally how, his son, Laksshya, changed his life forever.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 126 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tusshar Kapoor\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780143452898\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45905761108121,"sku":"11RC9780143452898","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691af3bac8500_Bachelor_Dad_My_Journey_to_Fatherhood_and_More.jpg?v=1763394809","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/bachelor-dad-my-journey-to-fatherhood-and-more","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}